  "summary": "DNS resolution while deserializing java.net.InetSocketAddress. 2.2.2 has no\nInetSocketAddress support at all: InetSocketAddressDeserializer (and its serializer)\nfirst ship in 2.3.0, and `git grep InetSocketAddress jackson-databind-2.2.2 -- src/main`\nfinds nothing, so InetSocketAddress values cannot be deserialized by this version and\nno lookup happens. (InetAddress deserialization, CVE-2026-77310, is patched.)\n",
